{"slides": [{"number": 1, "title": "音声からスライド動画を作る流れ", "content": "短い音声をもとに、文字起こしからアウトライン、スライド生成、動画化までの流れを確認します。", "key_message": "自然な日本語タイトルと読みやすい余白を優先します。"}, {"number": 2, "title": "日本語の読みやすさと復元確認", "content": "生成されたスライドの文字サイズ、改行、余白、保存後の確認に必要なメトリクスを見ます。", "key_message": "小さい文字やタイトル欠けを避け、編集しやすいスライドを目指します。"}], "strategy": {"content_analysis": {"core_message": "音声から始まる、読みやすく確かなスライド動画づくりの流れ", "emotional_tone": "落ち着いていて知的、信頼感と前向きな期待感", "key_concepts": ["音声入力", "スライド動画", "日本語の可読性", "復元確認", "ワークフロー"], "target_audience": "コンテンツ制作者、教育・研修担当者、ビジネスパーソン"}, "design_style": {"concept_name": "Quiet Signal — 静かに伝わる、確かな設計", "concept_description": "音声という見えない情報を、整った日本語と落ち着いた色彩で『見える形』に変えるエディトリアルデザイン。深いインクブルーに、温かみのあるアンバーゴールドを差し色として配置し、知性と人間味の両立を表現する。タイポグラフィを主役に据え、余白を大きく取り、文字そのものの存在感で語らせる。", "color_palette": {"primary": "#1F3A5F", "secondary": "#E8DCC4", "accent": "#D4A24C", "background_start": "#0F1E33", "background_end": "#1F3A5F"}, "typography_direction": "見出しは丸みのある和文ゴシックで親しみと骨格を両立。本文はクリアで読みやすいサンセリフ和文。文字サイズのコントラストを強くつけ、余白を主役に。", "visual_theme": "音の波形をモチーフにした細い水平ライン、紙のような微かなグレイン、アンバーのアクセントドットや細い区切り線。装飾は最小限で、タイポグラフィと余白で構成する。", "headline_font_family": "Zen Kaku Gothic New", "body_font_family": "Noto Sans JP", "font_imports": ["Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@500;700;900", "Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700"], "accent_treatments": ["soft-glow", "grain-texture", "thin-horizontal-rule", "amber-dot-marker"], "slide_layouts": [{"slide_number": 1, "layout_key": "left_heavy", "override_hints": "大きな見出し『音声からスライド動画を作る流れ』を左側に縦に大きく配置、必ず単語境界『音声から／スライド動画を／作る流れ』で改行し語中で1文字分断しない。右側に細い水平ラインで区切られた工程のステップ表示（番号は大きなアンバーゴールド数字、各ステップ名は中サイズ）。余白を大きく取り、注釈は極力出さない。背景にごく薄い波形ライン装飾。"}, {"slide_number": 2, "layout_key": "center_hero", "override_hints": "見出し『日本語の読みやすさと復元確認』を画面中央に超大型で配置、改行は『日本語の読みやすさと／復元確認』のように意味のまとまりで行い語中分断禁止。見出しの下にアンバーゴールドの細い区切り線を一本、その下に短い一文サブコピーのみ。左右上下に大きな余白。背景に微かなグレインと中央放射状のソフトグロウ。"}]}, "_design_mode": "pro", "_copy_style_request": "自然な日本語で、元の意味を変えない。"}, "html_contents": ["<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>音声からスライド動画を作る流れ</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    width: 1920px; height: 1080px; overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F1E33 0%, #1F3A5F 100%);\n    color: #E8DCC4;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  body {\n    padding: 90px 110px !important;\n    display: flex; align-items: center;\n  }\n  /* グレイン */\n  body::before {\n    content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(232,220,196,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 3px 3px;\n    pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  /* 波形装飾 */\n  .waves {\n    position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .waves span {\n    position: absolute; left: -5%; right: -5%; height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(212,162,76,0.22) 30%, rgba(232,220,196,0.14) 60%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  .waves span:nth-child(1) { top: 16%; }\n  .waves span:nth-child(2) { top: 30%; opacity:0.5;}\n  .waves span:nth-child(3) { top: 80%; }\n  .waves span:nth-child(4) { top: 90%; opacity:0.4;}\n  /* 角の装飾 */\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute; width: 90px; height: 90px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(212,162,76,0.35);\n    z-index: 3; pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .corner.tl { top: 50px; left: 60px; border-right: none; border-bottom: none; }\n  .corner.br { bottom: 50px; right: 60px; border-left: none; border-top: none; }\n\n  .stage {\n    position: relative; z-index: 2;\n    width: 100%; height: 100%;\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 54% 46%;\n    align-items: center; gap: 70px;\n  }\n\n  /* 左 */\n  .left { padding-right: 10px; }\n  .eyebrow {\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;\n    font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.4em;\n    color: #D4A24C; font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 48px; text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  .eyebrow .dot {\n    width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(212,162,76,0.7);\n  }\n  .eyebrow .rule {\n    flex: 0 0 80px; height: 1px; background: #D4A24C; opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-family: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 112px;\n    line-height: 1.16;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\n    text-align: left; margin: 0;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    white-space: normal; overflow: visible;\n    overflow-wrap: normal; \n    line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance; white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  h1.title .amber {\n    color: #FBBF24;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(212,162,76,0.45); white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  .title-rule {\n    width: 160px; height: 2px;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    margin-top: 56px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(212,162,76,0.6); white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  .caption {\n    margin-top: 32px;\n    font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.28em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.6);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n\n  /* 右 ステップ */\n  .right {\n    position: relative;\n    padding-left: 36px;\n    border-left: 1px solid rgba(232,220,196,0.14);\n    height: 78%;\n    display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .step {\n    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;\n    align-items: center; gap: 28px;\n    padding: 22px 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232,220,196,0.1);\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .step::before {\n    content: ''; position: absolute;\n    left: -41px; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%);\n    width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #1F3A5F; border: 1px solid rgba(212,162,76,0.5);\n  }\n  .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n  .step .num {\n    font-family: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 92px;\n    color: #D4A24C;\n    line-height: 1;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(212,162,76,0.35);\n  }\n  .step .label {\n    font-family: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 38px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  }\n  .step .sub {\n    display: block;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;\n    color: rgba(212,162,76,0.75);\n    letter-spacing: 0.34em;\n    margin-top: 10px;\n  }\n\n  /* スライド番号 */\n  .pager {\n    position: absolute; bottom: 50px; right: 80px;\n    font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.3em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.5);\n    font-weight: 700; z-index: 5;\n  }\n  .pager b { color: #D4A24C; }\n\n  /* 左下マーク */\n  .brand {\n    position: absolute; bottom: 50px; left: 110px;\n    font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: 0.4em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.5);\n    font-weight: 700; z-index: 5;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .brand .d {\n    width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(212,162,76,0.6);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"waves\">\n<span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"corner tl\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner br\"></div>\n<div class=\"stage\">\n<div class=\"left\">\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">\n<span class=\"dot\"></span>\n<span>Workflow</span>\n<span class=\"rule\"></span>\n</div>\n<h1 class=\"title\">\n        音声から<br/>\n        スライド動画を<br/>\n<span class=\"amber\">作る流れ</span>\n</h1>\n<div class=\"title-rule\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"right\">\n<div class=\"step\">\n<div class=\"num\">01</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"label\">声を録る</div>\n<span class=\"sub\">RECORD</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step\">\n<div class=\"num\">02</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"label\">文字に起こす</div>\n<span class=\"sub\">TRANSCRIBE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step\">\n<div class=\"num\">03</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"label\">構成を整える</div>\n<span class=\"sub\">STRUCTURE</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step\">\n<div class=\"num\">04</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"label\">スライドへ起こす</div>\n<span class=\"sub\">DESIGN</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"step\">\n<div class=\"num\">05</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"label\">動画として書き出す</div>\n<span class=\"sub\">EXPORT</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"brand\"><span class=\"d\"></span>VOICE  TO  SLIDE</div>\n<div class=\"pager\"><b>01</b>  /  02</div>\n</body>\n</html>", "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html lang=\"ja\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<title>日本語の読みやすさと、復元の確認</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;700;900&amp;family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@400;700;900&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  \n  body {\n    width: 1920px;\n    height: 1080px;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #1F3A5F 0%, #0F1E33 70%);\n    color: #E8DCC4;\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  \n  /* Grain texture */\n  body::before {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background-image: \n      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(232,220,196,0.03) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 60%, rgba(232,220,196,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      radial-gradient(circle at 40% 80%, rgba(232,220,196,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 3px 3px, 5px 5px, 7px 7px;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n  }\n  \n  /* Soft central glow */\n  body::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    width: 1500px;\n    height: 1500px;\n    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,162,76,0.14) 0%, rgba(212,162,76,0.05) 30%, transparent 60%);\n    pointer-events: none;\n    filter: blur(40px);\n  }\n  \n  .stage {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  \n  /* Top meta bar */\n  .meta-top {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 60px;\n    left: 100px;\n    right: 100px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.5);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n  \n  .meta-top .left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  \n  .amber-dot {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(212,162,76,0.7);\n  }\n  \n  /* Waveform lines decoration */\n  .wave-deco {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    transform: translateX(-50%);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n    opacity: 0.2;\n  }\n  \n  .wave-deco.top { top: 190px; }\n  .wave-deco.bottom { bottom: 190px; }\n  \n  .wave-deco .line {\n    height: 1px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, #E8DCC4 50%, transparent 100%);\n  }\n  \n  .wave-deco .line:nth-child(1) { width: 280px; }\n  .wave-deco .line:nth-child(2) { width: 460px; }\n  .wave-deco .line:nth-child(3) { width: 200px; }\n  .wave-deco .line:nth-child(4) { width: 360px; }\n  \n  /* Eyebrow */\n  .eyebrow {\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.55em;\n    color: #D4A24C;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 64px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 24px;\n  }\n  \n  .eyebrow .bar {\n    width: 48px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n  }\n  \n  /* Main headline */\n  h1 {\n    font-family: 'Zen Kaku Gothic New', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    font-size: 112px;\n    line-height: 1.22;\n    letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    text-align: center;\n    white-space: normal;\n    overflow: visible;\n    overflow-wrap: normal;\n    \n    line-break: strict;\n    max-width: 95%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(212,162,76,0.18), 0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.25); white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  \n  h1 .accent {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FBBF24 0%, #D4A24C 100%);\n    -webkit-background-clip: text;\n    background-clip: text;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  \n  h1 .comma {\n    color: #D4A24C;\n    -webkit-text-fill-color: #D4A24C; white-space: normal; overflow: visible; overflow-wrap: normal; word-break: keep-all; line-break: strict; text-wrap: balance;}\n  \n  /* Amber divider */\n  .divider {\n    width: 140px;\n    height: 2px;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    margin: 72px auto 52px;\n    position: relative;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212,162,76,0.55);\n  }\n  \n  .divider::before, .divider::after {\n    content: '';\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    width: 6px;\n    height: 6px;\n    background: #D4A24C;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n  \n  .divider::before { left: -22px; }\n  .divider::after { right: -22px; }\n  \n  /* Subcopy */\n  .subcopy {\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.9);\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n  }\n  \n  /* Bottom meta */\n  .meta-bottom {\n    position: absolute;\n    bottom: 60px;\n    left: 100px;\n    right: 100px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.35em;\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.45);\n  }\n  \n  .slide-number {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #D4A24C;\n    letter-spacing: 0.22em;\n  }\n  \n  .slide-number span {\n    color: rgba(232,220,196,0.4);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  \n  /* Corner ornaments */\n  .corner {\n    position: absolute;\n    width: 64px;\n    height: 64px;\n    border-color: rgba(212,162,76,0.45);\n  }\n  \n  .corner.tl { top: 110px; left: 110px; border-top: 1px solid; border-left: 1px solid; }\n  .corner.tr { top: 110px; right: 110px; border-top: 1px solid; border-right: 1px solid; }\n  .corner.bl { bottom: 110px; left: 110px; border-bottom: 1px solid; border-left: 1px solid; }\n  .corner.br { bottom: 110px; right: 110px; border-bottom: 1px solid; border-right: 1px solid; }\n  \n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"stage\">\n<div class=\"meta-top\">\n<div class=\"left\">\n<span class=\"amber-dot\"></span>\n<span>Quiet Signal</span>\n</div>\n<div>Closing — Verification</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"corner tl\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner tr\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner bl\"></div>\n<div class=\"corner br\"></div>\n<div class=\"wave-deco top\">\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wave-deco bottom\">\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n<div class=\"line\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">\n<span class=\"bar\"></span>\n<span>Final Check</span>\n<span class=\"bar\"></span>\n</div>\n<h1>日本語の読みやすさと復元確認</h1>\n<div class=\"divider\"></div>\n<p class=\"subcopy\">\n      意味を変えずに、自然な言葉として整っているか。<br/>\n      静かに、最後の一手を確かめる。\n    </p>\n<div class=\"meta-bottom\">\n<div>Editorial Design — Voice to Text</div>\n<div class=\"slide-number\">02 <span>/ 02</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"], "design_quality_metrics": [{"min_font_size_px": 28.0, "title_font_size_px": 112.0, "body_font_size_px_min": 28.0, "main_element_occupancy_ratio": 1.0, "blank_area_ratio_estimate": 0.0, "text_clipping_detected": false, "small_text_count": 0, "fallback_used": false, "quality_gate": "pass", "warnings": [], "slide_number": 1}, {"min_font_size_px": 34.0, "title_font_size_px": 112.0, "body_font_size_px_min": 34.0, "main_element_occupancy_ratio": 1.0, "blank_area_ratio_estimate": 0.0, "text_clipping_detected": false, "small_text_count": 0, "fallback_used": false, "quality_gate": "pass", "warnings": [], "slide_number": 2}]}